2. Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard — v4 evaluation data
================================================================================

Location:  src/mini_thalamus/evals/external/bfcl_data/

Source:    https://huggingface.co/datasets/gorilla-llm/Berkeley-Function-Calling-Leaderboard
           and the BFCL v4 information mirror `tuandunghcmut/BFCL_v4_information`

License:   Apache License 2.0

Redistributed here so the offline categories can be scored without network
access. Re-fetch with `python -m mini_thalamus.evals.download_bfcl`.


